<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Who is hiring · London Seed Radar</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Georgia, serif; max-width: 44rem; margin: 2rem auto;
         padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #1a1a1a; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
  .banner { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #e0c869; padding: .6rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .company { margin: 1.6rem 0; }
  .muted { color: #666; font-size: .9rem; }
  .grad { background: #e8f4e8; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 .35rem;
          font-size: .85rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  ul { margin: .4rem 0 0 1.2rem; padding: 0; }
  li { margin: .2rem 0; }
  a { color: #0b5394; }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #666;
           border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p><a href="index.html">London Seed Radar</a> / who is hiring</p>
<h1>Who is hiring</h1>
<p>Live roles on public job boards at companies featured in the radar.
🎓 marks a role a recent grad could apply for; 🌐 marks a role that can
be done remotely. Both are guessed from the posting text alone, so read
the posting before applying. Job boards change daily, so treat this page
as a snapshot from when it was generated.</p>
{% if sample_data %}
<p class="banner">Sample data: the entries below were generated from
recorded test fixtures to demonstrate the pipeline. The companies are
fictional. Live data replaces this after the first real issue.</p>
{% endif %}

{% for group in groups %}
<div class="company">
  <h2>{{ group.company.name }}</h2>
  <p class="muted">{{ group.stage_label }} · {{ group.amount_label }}
  {%- if group.company.website %} · <a href="{{ group.company.website }}">{{ group.company.domain or group.company.website }}</a>{% endif %}</p>
  <p>{{ group.company.one_liner }}</p>
  <ul>
  {% for role in group.roles %}
    <li><a href="{{ role.url }}">{{ role.title }}</a>{% if role.junior %} <span class="grad">🎓 grad-friendly title</span>{% endif %}{% if role.remote %} <span class="grad">🌐 remote</span>{% endif %}{% if role.location %} <span class="muted">· {{ role.location }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="muted">No live roles right now. Check back after the next issue.</p>
{% endfor %}

<footer>
Generated {{ generated }} by the London Seed Radar pipeline.
Roles come from public ATS job boards (Greenhouse, Ashby, Lever);
no personal contact data. Corrections welcome via GitHub issues.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
